OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother day of frequent
OL,6,Fshowers, heavy at times, and some
OL,7,Fsunny intervals. A windy day with west
OL,8,Fto northwesterly gales at first over
OL,9,FIsles and western coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRather cloudy at first with
OL,12,Fscattered to frequent showers, these
OL,13,Fbecoming lighter and more isolated
OL,14,Fthrough the evening and overnight,
OL,15,Fallowing a few more clear spells to
OL,16,Fdevelop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,179,160,301,260,100,100
PN,17802
