OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FThe odd light shower around
OL,6,FNorth Argyll and the Isles at first.
OL,7,FOtherwise dry with sunny spells by
OL,8,Fday. Freshening winds with cloud and
OL,9,Fpatchy rain late in the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,12,FMonday with patchy rain. Early rain
OL,13,Fclearing on Tuesday then sunshine and
OL,14,Fshowers, windy at times. Cloudy and
OL,15,Fwindy Wednesday with rain, heaviest
OL,16,Fand most persistent in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
